msgctxt "92"
msgid "(A girl in a straw hat...? Is this the lost kid?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Hey. Is your name Sakura, by any chance?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"That's right, mister. But why...? Oh, I know! You must have seen me on TV, "
"right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"(That woman said something about TV, didn't she? I guess this must be "
"Sakura.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "(I'll go get her mother.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Your mother's been looking for you. Wait here⑬I'll go get her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "Sakura! Where on earth have you been!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Huh!? Who are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Wait, are you... <Italic>the</Italic> Sakura-chan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"Hold on, you said you were looking for your daughter. Is this Sakura or not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Well, ah, that <Italic>is</Italic> my daughter's name, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "I'm Kanako Sakura. What's going on here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr "...Eh?"

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"Don't tell me you don't recognize her! She's a famous TV celebrity! My "
"daughter's a big fan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "This is turning into a bigger headache than I was expecting..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "But I do think that's the same hat my Sakura was wearing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"You mean this? Isn't it adorable? I swapped hats with a girl I met over "
"there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "She wanted the baseball cap I was wearing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Well, she's your biggest fan! No wonder she wanted to trade."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry to bother you again, but, ah... would you mind looking for my "
"daughter again? My Sakura?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"I guess not... So now we're looking for a girl in a baseball cap, right? "
"I'll see if I can find her."
msgstr ""

